If you have a large, running snapshot, then you may run into:

```json
{
  "error": {
    "root_cause": [
      {
        "type": "snapshot_in_progress_exception",
        "reason": "Cannot delete indices that are being snapshotted: [[my-index]]. Try again after snapshot finishes or cancel the currently running snapshot."
      }
    ],
